    ["{{\"目标属性名(比如Hp)\",\"源属性名(比如MaxHp)\",\"属性恢复方式(0:按源属性的百分比；1:按绝对数值)\",\"数值(绝对的数值或者百分比值)\"}}"] = "{{\"Target Attribute Name (e.g., ОЗ)\",\"Source Attribute Name (e.g., MaxHp)\",\"Attribute Recovery Method (0: Percentage of source attribute; 1: Absolute value)\",\"Value (Absolute value or percentage value)\"}}",
